usage: aiopsctl plugin verify <spec> [--builder image|local] [--against <release>] [--modcache <dir>] [--mirror <prefix>=<site prefix>]...

Verify the signer of an artifact and run its suites.

Flags:
  --builder image|local            the builder: the builder image, or the local toolchain
  --against <release>              the release artifact, by digest, to build against
  --modcache <dir>                 the module cache the build reads
  --mirror <prefix>=<site prefix>  read the modules under a prefix from the site's mirror

Exit codes:
  0  success, or help that was asked for
  1  a denial, a failed step, rebuild-required, an interrupt or a failed boot; the reason is on stderr
  2  a usage error; a Go panic outside every fiber also exits 2, with the trace of the runtime
